{
  "name": "knight-battle",
  "extends": "../artbook.json",
  "_comment": "Battle-ready LOW-GUARD still, built as a SKELETON on the enlarged 32px-era rig: the chest is the root (its 'hips' pinned to the canvas) and every other part attaches at a named anchor (head.neck -> chest.neck, legs' hip -> chest.hip_l/hip_r, arm.shoulder -> chest.shoulder_r, sword.grip -> arm.hand, shield.center -> chest torso). The sword ARM hangs while the blade points up (a hanging/low guard). The shield is recoloured to the red surcoat ramp so it reads against the blue steel. Parts meet by construction, so leaning the chest can't open a gap. The 'checks' encode the art direction as pass/fail predicates.",
  "size": [
    46,
    42
  ],
  "scale": 8,
  "checks": [
    { "rule": "connected" },
    { "rule": "on_canvas", "margin": 0 },
    { "rule": "centered_x", "layer": "shield", "in": ["chest", "back-leg", "front-leg"], "tol": 3 },
    { "rule": "top_above", "layer": "sword", "of": "chest" },
    { "rule": "touches", "layer": "front-leg" },
    { "rule": "touches", "layer": "sword", "of": "sword-arm" }
  ],
  "skeleton": [
    {
      "name": "back-leg",
      "shape": "knight_leg",
      "pivot": "hip",
      "attach": { "to": "chest", "anchor": "hip_l", "shift": [ -2, 0 ] },
      "skew": [ -0.4, 0.0 ]
    },
    {
      "name": "front-leg",
      "shape": "knight_leg",
      "pivot": "hip",
      "attach": { "to": "chest", "anchor": "hip_r", "shift": [ 2, 0 ] },
      "skew": [ 0.4, 0.0 ]
    },
    {
      "name": "chest",
      "shape": "knight_chest",
      "pivot": "hips",
      "at": [ 22, 28 ],
      "skew": [ -0.1, 0.0 ]
    },
    {
      "name": "shield",
      "shape": "shield",
      "pivot": "center",
      "attach": { "to": "chest", "anchor": "hips", "shift": [ -2, -2 ] },
      "recolor": { "steel": "cloak", "steel_hi": "cloak_hi", "steel_sh": "cloak_sh", "steel_dk": "cloak_sh" }
    },
    {
      "name": "sword-arm",
      "shape": "knight_arm",
      "pivot": "shoulder",
      "attach": { "to": "chest", "anchor": "shoulder_r" },
      "rotate": 145
    },
    {
      "name": "sword",
      "shape": "sword_long",
      "pivot": "grip",
      "attach": { "to": "sword-arm", "anchor": "hand" },
      "rotate": 33
    },
    {
      "name": "head",
      "shape": "knight_head_3q",
      "pivot": "neck",
      "attach": { "to": "chest", "anchor": "neck" }
    }
  ]
}
